flowchart TD
    A[bookmark action] --> B{folder chosen?}
    B -->|no| C[default folder]
    B -->|yes| D[named folder]
    C --> E[upsert interaction type=BOOKMARK folder=default]
    D --> E2[upsert interaction folder=name]
    F[create folder] --> G[add to user folder list]
    H[delete folder] --> I[orphaned bookmarks migrate to default]
    I --> J[folder removed]
    E & E2 --> K[bookmarks view grouped by folder]
    G --> K
    J --> K
